# Cloud-Inferenz: start a cloud run on this robot (physical_ai_server). session_token (the connect
# token) and edge_token (the Modal session's edge token) are the one-time credentials the cloud API
# issued to the signed-in student for this run; the node hands both to its cloud client and never
# echoes, stores, logs or copies them into TaskInfo/TaskStatus.
TaskInfo task_info
string session_token
string edge_token
---
bool success
string message
